ng>Advantages of translocation at Nkhotakota Wildlife Park</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>- 38.&nbsp;<input type=\"text\">&nbsp;opportunities<br>- a reduction in the number of poachers and 39.&nbsp;<input type=\"text\"><br>- an example of conservation that other parks can follow<br>- an increase in 40.&nbsp;<input type=\"text\">&nbsp;as a contributor to GDP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>','','','This is a sample audio 2 transcript.',0,20,'',2),(81,'Audio','<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 132.8px; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 25.0164%;\"><col style=\"width: 25.0164%;\"><col style=\"width: 25.0164%;\"><col style=\"width: 25.0164%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">col1</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">col1</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">col1</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">col1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">vv</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2px;\">\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px;\">v</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','','This is a sample audio 3 transcript.',0,20,'',3),(82,'Audio','section 4 requirement here','','','This is a sample audio 4 transcript.',0,20,'',4),(83,'FormCompletion','1, ___','a1','','a1',79,20,'',1),(84,'FormCompletion','2, ___','a2','','ex2',79,20,'',2),(85,'FormCompletion','3,___','a3','','ex3',79,20,'',3),(86,'FormCompletion','4,__','a4','','ex4',79,20,'',4),(87,'Form